<title>USA: TV Azteca sets $425 mln 144A notes in 2-part deal.</title>
<headline>TV Azteca sets $425 mln 144A notes in 2-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt deal was priced in the private placement market from TV Azteca SA was priced on Friday, via Bear Stearns &amp; Co, said a syndicate source familiar with the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER TV AZTECA SA</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 10.125 PCT MATURITY 2/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR GTD NOTES ISS PRICE 99.87   FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 10.15 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 375 BPS    MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT 50</p>
<p>						 BASIS POINTS OVER U.S.</p>
<p>						     TREASURIES</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT 110.125.  </p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR GTD NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997 LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 400 BPS    CALLABLE MAKE-WHOLE CALL</p>
<p>						 AT 50 BASIS POINTS OVER</p>
<p>						 U.S. TREASURIES FOR</p>
<p>							FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PERCENT AT 110.50</p>
</text>
